ncy and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aGbiCTwJhqkQ7kNvwHeZWys&_nc_oc=AdqeaomINOJzkqv3XRdeKMaY1UdKnJ1N2sHzOsIriVpZ-WDevCCepyWkEpNDu8n5kwM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFGZzsi2XM5cMu2XZsSNXYGrr19lvd_Bj3dgUC7DIVVZQ&oe=6A8AF639"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uOkeMAJBx2YQ7kNvwFT0t4I&_nc_oc=AdoPUcApsUOk-Pj2lIBrOFh779FYHCSEzsswKRmFFsP4sKnLprl5oth0kJfcKr5Dfxg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHZY08Ng9UoWVeZRkTh1oeSrQof2IAuJuz1bYX65j5OFw&oe=6A8AE48F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Ty-OIq7c5EQ7kNvwF3GWzT&_nc_oc=AdpHpDa_sIWSiTdQFZjDpSKiNYa6cMOPtBUzrPTLfTijIQxmYWrEhIbxOJuXNzCwPwg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGFRf7PLGazb2B3Dy_ujWiu9aY3O7em-kmOQniwqZqqTQ&oe=6A8AF26E"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squar